      "html": "<p>A driver cannot check brake pad thickness, disc condition, bearing play or shock absorbers from the roadside.</p><p>How often depends on how hard the vehicle works, and mileage alone does not set it.</p><p>A good walkaround does not make up for skipped maintenance. You need both. This is a free van safety checklist for any operator, on paper or on a phone.</p>"
